note <Cryptographically secure random bytes. The clean uniform interface; the per-env native implementation is selected at build time and hidden. Each platform delegates to its OS-backed cryptographic generator (node randomBytes, rust OsRng, swift SystemRandomNumberGenerator, kotlin SecureRandom, browser getRandomValues). The bytes are returned as lowercase hex text, so a request for `size` bytes yields a string of length `size * 2`. This is synchronous: every host exposes secure random generation without an async boundary.>

load @cluesurf/base/code/native/cryptography/random
  find random-bytes

task bytes
  take size, like number
  like text
  send back
    call random-bytes
      read size
